<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-053" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-053-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0005" ref="6bz_2xv_ow3">張紘</persName>文理意正，為世令器，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0017" ref="e9c_070_567">孫策</persName>待之亞於<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0023" ref="roi_rz4_ute">張昭</persName>，誠有以也，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0031" ref="szg_rhg_18d">嚴</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0033" ref="eus_x4z_ogu">程</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0035" ref="r2b_2xl_58l">闞生</persName>，一時儒林也。至<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0045" ref="szg_rhg_18d">畯</persName>辭榮濟舊，不亦長者乎！<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0057" ref="yt7_qwp_k7p">薛綜</persName>學識規納，為吳良臣。及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-appraisal:line074:m0070" ref="57a_8f8_a32">瑩</persName>纂蹈，允有先風，然於暴酷之朝，屢登顯列，君子殆諸。</p>
</text>
